{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09557","headline":"哭护国上人 · 张谓","name":"哭护国上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔喜三身净，今悲万劫长。\n不应归北斗，应是向西方。\n舍利衆生得，袈裟弟子将。\n鼠行残药椀，虫网旧绳牀。\n别起千花塔，空留一草堂。\n支公何处在，神理竟茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}